  "implementation_notes": [
    "Original33 module and rendered function bodies stay byte-identical. Combined wrapper only gathers file-scope includes, namespaces component bodies and replaces standalone main functions.",
    "Real builtin callable/type transformer, loaded table metadata, ComputeRequiredProps, pruning/inlining, stage assignment, aggregation propagation, global/local liveness and ID invariants are called.",
    "Row-read producer partial aggregation cannot push into the source stage, so actual final/intermediate producer aggregates remain in one consumer stage. The physical construction uses both actual producer builders on its generated stage argument; source-to-producer StageGraph edge is checked.",
    "Original producer pointer is checked before propagation. After real aggregate replacement, the one shared final producer and exact intermediate/result IU chain are checked instead of requiring the obsolete node pointer.",
    "Both public aggregation-builder block flags are exercised inside each positive case; this does not claim two full runtime configuration executions.",
    "Known-key grouped case has no domain. Keyless scalar cases require full result/count key-only domain; domain partial stays inside the exact secondary Switch branch, while primary lambda and producer expression stay pointer-identical.",
    "Reconstruction input-stage positions, exact port output indexes and left/right shuffle key IUs are checked. Physical field mapping uses frozen TPhysicalNames and lambda argument identity.",
    "Malformed direct-builder controls reject a foreign branch stream, a foreign domain input identity, and duplicate domain output fields. These are future native checks built only in RAM, not Python simulations or current execution evidence.",
    "Copied-SOME rejection checks the exact intended error internally and verifies registry size, original plan owner/filter/producer pointers, traits, output IDs, metadata keys, types and absence of a new hub; diagnostics are not emitted.",
    "Only verification files are patched. Existing guarded CLI, serial/memory policy, production version object replay, sealed read-only executable transport and provenance validation function bodies are unchanged."
  ],
